      "description": "Append one concise external reasoning summary. This records model-authored PLAN,\nBEFORE_TOOL, AFTER_TOOL, or FINAL entries; it does not request or expose hidden\nchain-of-thought and never establishes mathematical assurance. PLAN creates a run.\nBEFORE_TOOL reserves one capability call. AFTER_TOOL interprets the bound actual\nresult or explicitly records RESULT_UNAVAILABLE after a lost response or runtime\nrestart. FINAL audits the completed run. Do not copy prompts, secrets, payloads, or\nraw tool output into summary.\n",
      "inputSchema": {
        "$defs": {
          "CapabilityAssuranceLevel": {
            "description": "Coarse model-facing assurance without hiding the detailed result record.",
            "enum": [
              "HEURISTIC",
              "COMPUTED",
